        "created_at": "2018-01-05T17:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wonderful thanks.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Remember NightMist was a collaboration so I might have changed just to keep those two IPs separate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, Hello there Girl with No Name. (I just hear spaghetti&nbsp;western music when I hear your name. Now I need to see them all again.)</p>",
